**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
# The Dockerfile COPYs backend/data to /app/seed_data (the committed campaign
# JSONs; the Render disk mounts over /app/data and hides them). Exclude the
# directory but let the top-level JSON files through - everything else under
# it (SQLite, caches, bar files) stays out of the image.
backend/data/**
!backend/data/*.json
**/.env
.git
